l="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="120000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClr><a:schemeClr val="dk1"/></a:buClr><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"/><a:t>Medicinal plants play a vital role in </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>Ayurvedic</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"/><a:t> healthcare, but identifying them accurately often requires expert botanical knowledge. This project presents an AI-powered platform that automates medicinal plant identification using a </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>Vision Transformer (</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>ViT</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>)</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"/><a:t> model, which accurately recognizes plants from leaf images. Based on the identified plant or a selected disease, the system recommends suitable medicinal plants and provides detailed </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>Ayurvedic</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"/><a:t> medicinal guidance using the </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>Google Gemini</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"/><a:t> Large Language Model. By combining computer vision and generative AI, the proposed system offers an accessible, accurate, and intelligent solution for healthcare, education, and agricultural applications, making medicinal plant knowledge available to a wider audience.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="just" rtl="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="120000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClr><a:schemeClr val="dk1"/></a:buClr><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:e